WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.710
It is a work of beauty and precision.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:09.790
Each hour, each minute, each second is arrived at with absolute accuracy.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.000
It is composed of almost a thousand parts.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:18.640
Springs, gears, levers, wheels, jewels, glass.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:26.700
On the back are engraved the initials of the owner, JWB.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.560
This is the watch.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.320
Of a murderer.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.590
It is now 20 past two.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.240
He will kill at 10.17 tonight.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.890
What is it? What's wrong?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.630
It's nothing. It's a bad dream, that's all.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.230
Tell Mr. Hay to come in here, please.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.380
I told you I shouldn't take a nap after lunch.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.180
Not when I've stuffed myself with all that apple pie.

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:01.550
What did you dream?

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:02.270
Hmm?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.740
